<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-17587] The &quot;io.datastorage.StorageSize&quot; metric shows incorrect values in case of multiple persistence dataregions</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-17587</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The metric was broken after &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-13207&quot; title=&quot;Checkpointer code refactoring: Splitting GridCacheDatabaseSharedManager and Checkpointer&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-13207&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-13207&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: it sets the value of the last group instead of the sum of all groups. See &lt;tt&gt;DataStorageMetricsImpl#onStorageSizeChanged&lt;/tt&gt; for details.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
